{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15863","headline":"酬崔峝 · 王烈","name":"酬崔峝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"狥世甘长往，逢时忝一官。\n欲朝青琐去，羞向白云看。\n荣宠无心易，艰危抗节难。\n思君写怀抱，非敢和幽兰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王烈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}